  "I wrote a draft. Next I will lint it and preview fixes with the Master CSS MCP server.": "草稿已寫好。接著我會用 Master CSS MCP 伺服器 lint 它並預覽修正。",
  "Later layers win": "越後面的 layer 越優先",
