  "× larger": " 倍",
  "Not linted yet": "尚未 lint",
  "An MCP server for your AI agents": "給 AI agents 用的 MCP 伺服器",
  "Write native CSS and design tokens as class names. Master CSS checks them, shows what each change affects, and generates CSS only for the classes in your code.": "用 class 名稱寫原生 CSS 與設計 token。Master CSS 會檢查它們、標出每次變更的影響，並只為程式碼中用到的 class 產生 CSS。",
  "of CSS on the Master CSS docs page, Brotli": "Master CSS 文件頁的 CSS（Brotli）",
  "less CSS than the Tailwind CSS docs page": "相較 Tailwind CSS 文件頁的 CSS 精簡倍數",
  "of runtime with the default static setup": "預設靜態設定下的 runtime 大小",
  "set of Rust semantics, matched byte for byte in the browser": "套 Rust 語意，瀏覽器端逐位元組一致",
  "One vocabulary for your design system.": "一套詞彙，撐起整個設計系統。",
  "Themes, tokens, layout and motion stay readable in markup, and the CSS they generate stays predictable.": "主題、token、版面與動態都留在 markup 中，好讀，產生的 CSS 也可預期。",
  "Modes without forks": "切換模式，不必分岔",
  "Light, dark and custom modes switch through the same tokens. The markup stays the same.": "淺色、深色與自訂模式透過同一組 token 切換，markup 一行不改。",
  "Tokens, defined once": "Token，只定義一次",
  "Set color, spacing, radius and type once. Utilities, components and modes all read from them.": "色彩、間距、圓角與字體只定義一次，utilities、元件與各種模式都從這裡取值。",
  "Wide-gamut color": "廣色域色彩",
  "P3 palettes on a predictable tier scale, from deep anchors to bright accents.": "P3 色盤搭配可預期的色階，從沉穩的基底色到明亮的強調色。",
  "Grid, responsive spans, animation and view transitions, written right beside the UI.": "Grid、響應式跨欄、動畫與 view transitions，直接寫在 UI 旁。",
  "Write components in native CSS with mixins and nesting. Utilities sit in a later layer, so a class in markup wins without !important.": "用原生 CSS 搭配 mixin 與巢狀語法寫元件。utilities 位於較後的 layer，markup 中的 class 不需 !important 就能生效。",
  "Static CSS by default. Pre-render it into HTML, hydrate it progressively, or generate it in the browser. Your classes stay the same.": "預設輸出靜態 CSS，也可以提前渲染進 HTML、漸進式 hydrate，或在瀏覽器中產生。寫法完全不變。",
  "Scan class names at build time and ship a plain stylesheet. No runtime in the browser.": "在建置時掃描 class 名稱，交付一般樣式表。瀏覽器裡沒有 runtime。",
  "Render first-load CSS on the server or at build time. The runtime starts its engine only for classes outside that CSS.": "在伺服器或建置時渲染首次載入的 CSS；只有遇到這份 CSS 以外的 class，runtime 才會啟動引擎。",
  "Generate rules in the browser for classes that first appear there, from editors, CMS content or playgrounds.": "為首次出現在瀏覽器中的 class 產生規則，例如來自編輯器、CMS 內容或 playground。",
  "The CSS each documentation page delivers, measured raw and with Brotli. Master CSS sends the rules a page uses, not a framework.": "量測各文件頁實際交付的 CSS，包含原始大小與 Brotli 壓縮後。Master CSS 只送出頁面用到的規則，而不是整個框架。",
  "Lint rules your team and agents share.": "團隊與 agents 共用的 lint 規則。",
  "ESLint, the CLI and the MCP server run the same rules, so agents catch problems in their own changes and hand you fixes as diffs.": "ESLint、CLI 與 MCP 伺服器執行同一套規則，agents 能自己抓出變更中的問題，並以 diff 交給你修正。",
  "Agents lint what they wrote, preview fixes as a diff, and apply them only if the files are unchanged.": "Agent 先 lint 自己寫的檔案，以 diff 預覽修正，確認檔案沒被改動才套用。",
  "Catch classes that parse but produce invalid CSS.": "抓出語法正確、卻產生無效 CSS 的 class。",
  "Sort classes into a stable order and drop duplicates, so diffs stay small.": "把 class 排成穩定順序並移除重複，讓 diff 保持精簡。",
  "Find classes that set the same property in the same variant scope.": "找出在同一個變體範圍內設定相同屬性的 class。",
  "Opt in to reject classes and tokens your project manifest does not generate.": "選擇啟用後，拒絕專案 manifest 不會產生的 class 與 token。",
  "Opt in to require project tokens for token-backed properties, with an allowlist for raw values.": "選擇啟用後，有 token 的屬性一律使用專案 token，原始值需列入允許清單。",
  "Fixes come back as a diff with a confirmation token, before anything is written.": "修正以 diff 搭配確認 token 回傳，寫入之前先讓你審查。",
  "Completions from your manifest, generated CSS on hover, color swatches and focused highlighting.": "依 manifest 補全、懸停檢視產生的 CSS、色塊預覽與情境式高亮。",
  "Hover a class to see the CSS it generates, including its state and query.": "游標移到 class 上，就能看到它產生的 CSS，包含狀態與查詢條件。",
  "Manifest completions": "依 manifest 補全",
  "Complete utilities, values, selectors, queries and tokens from your project manifest.": "依專案 manifest 補全 utilities、值、選擇器、查詢條件與 token。",
  "Focused highlighting": "情境式高亮",
  "Markup stays calm until the cursor enters a class string; then its class context lights up.": "游標進入 class 字串前，markup 保持安靜；進入後才高亮目前的 class 情境。",
  "A swatch beside every color class that resolves to one color. Edit literal colors with the native picker.": "每個可解析為單一顏色的 class 旁都有色塊，字面色值能用原生取色器直接編輯。",
  "Connect agents over MCP, see what a token change touches, and run the same lint rules in ESLint, CI and agent sessions.": "透過 MCP 串接 agents、看清 token 變更會影響哪裡，並在 ESLint、CI 與 agent 工作階段執行同一套 lint 規則。",
  "Agents get your manifest, scanner and lint rules. They inspect classes, lint their changes and preview fixes as diffs.": "Agents 取得專案的 manifest、掃描器與 lint 規則，能檢視 class、lint 自己的變更，並以 diff 預覽修正。",
  "Trace a change": "追蹤一次變更",
  "Snapshot the project, change a token or recipe, and see the definitions, consumers and rules it touches.": "先替專案建立快照，改動 token 或 recipe 後，就能看到受影響的定義、使用處與規則。",
  "Vite, Astro, Next.js, Nuxt, SvelteKit, webpack and more, on the same project manifest and rendering modes.": "Vite、Astro、Next.js、Nuxt、SvelteKit、webpack 等整合，共用同一份專案 manifest 與編譯模式。",
  "Monorepo-aware": "支援 monorepo",
  "Completions, hover, colors and directive diagnostics follow the nearest Master CSS project.": "補全、懸停、色彩與 directive 診斷都會跟隨最近的 Master CSS 專案。",
  "Route stylesheets use shared tokens, mixins and custom media without copying global rules.": "路由樣式表可使用共用的 token、mixin 與 custom media，不必複製全域規則。",
  "ESLint, the CLI and the MCP server share each rule and its fixes. Options in eslint.config.js apply to ESLint.": "ESLint、CLI 與 MCP 伺服器共用每條規則與修正；eslint.config.js 的選項只作用於 ESLint。",
  "Add Master CSS to your framework, style in markup, and move shared decisions into tokens as the design settles.": "把 Master CSS 加進你的框架、直接在 markup 中寫樣式，等設計穩定後再把共用決策收進 token。",
  "Start with a class.": "從一個 class 開始，",
  "Grow a design system.": "長成一套設計系統。"
}
